  "description": "Discover local businesses through Google Maps geographic search and business listings. Best for B2B local lead generation \u2014 find businesses by type and location (e.g., 'dentists in Chicago' or 'restaurants in Mumbai'). Captures business name, address, phone number, website, ratings, reviews, and hours. Use when targeting brick-and-mortar businesses or service providers in specific geographic areas.",
