  "tips": "- searchStringsArray items should be \"<business category> in <city/region>\" format for best results.\n- locationQuery should match the target city/region from the ICP.\n- Keep maxCrawledPlacesPerSearch between 10-50 for reasonable results.\n- MULTIPLE SEARCHES: When the ICP targets 3 or more distinct business categories, generate MULTIPLE search inputs wrapped in a \"searches\" array. Split by business category so each search is focused and produces clean results.\n- For 1-2 categories, return a single flat JSON object without the \"searches\" wrapper.",
